            <ArticleTitle>Stent fracture and restenosis of a paclitaxel-eluting stent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>439-42</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe the case of a patient with restenosis six months after stent implantation, at two points where stent fracture had occurred. Fracture is an unusual and probably underestimated cause of restenosis, which acquires special significance in this era of drug-eluting stents.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
